    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, my knee has been killing me lately, think its that osteoarthritis acting up again. i really need something for the swelling. i'm currently on eliquis for my afib, but i was wondering if i could just take some high dose ibuprofen to get the inflammation down? like how much can i take without it being an issue?",
